  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Black Spear Task Force",
    "summary": "As [your Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins, you can pick a Mission Tactic from the list below. It stays active for all your units with this ability until [your next Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase). No Mission Tactic can be picked more than once in the battle.\n\n- **Furor Tactics**: while it is active, weapons of your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units get **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.\n- **Malleus Tactics**: while it is active, weapons of your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units get **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)**.\n- **Purgatus Tactics**: while it is active, whenever an attack by an **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** unit of yours scores a Critical Hit, that attack gets **[[PRECISION]](vsdata:weapon-ability/precision)**.",
